#: index.docbook:84
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "आमुख"

#: index.docbook:85
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&rkward; is meant to be(come) an easy to use graphical frontend to the "
"powerful &R; language for statistical computing. Since &R; is a full "
"featured programming language, &rkward; will never be able to offer a "
"complete GUI for everything in &R;. However, &rkward; strives to make "
"common task simple, to provide an easy entry point for newcomers, while at "
"the same time, transparent access to the full power of the underlying &R; "
"language is provided for advanced users."
msgstr ""
"&rkward; शक्तिशालिनः &R; सांख्यिकीयगणनायाः कृते भाषा। यतः &R; "
"पूर्णविशेषतायुक्ता प्रोग्रामिंगभाषा अस्ति, &rkward; &R;मध्ये सर्वस्य कृते "
"कदापि सम्पूर्णं GUI प्रदातुं न शक्ष्यति । तथापि &rkward; सामान्यं कार्यं "
"सरलं कर्तुं, नव आगन्तुकानां कृते सुलभं प्रवेशबिन्दुं प्रदातुं, तत्सहकालं च, "
"अन्तर्निहितस्य &R; उन्नतप्रयोक्तृणां कृते भाषा प्रदत्ता अस्ति।"

#: index.docbook:91
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &rkward;"
msgstr "&rkward इत्यस्य उपयोगेन;"

#: index.docbook:93
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most documentation is available from inside &rkward; itself by selecting "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>Help</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice> in &rkward; from the menu, <emphasis>not</emphasis> in this "
"document."
msgstr ""
"अधिकांशं दस्तावेजीकरणं अन्तः एव उपलभ्यते &rkward; स्वयं &rkward; मेनूतः, "
"अस्मिन् दस्तावेजे <emphasis>not</emphasis> इति ।"

#: index.docbook:96
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A useful guide to getting started with &rkward; is <ulink "
"url=\"https://rkward.kde.org/User_Documentation\">User Documentation "
"Section in the &rkward; wiki</ulink>."
msgstr ""
"&rkward; इति <ulink "
"url=\"https://rkward.kde.org/User_Documentation\">उपयोक्तृदस्तावेजविभागः "
"&rkward; विकि</ulink> इति ।"

#: index.docbook:99
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Please go there for an introduction to &rkward;, and contact us, if you can "
"help with creating user documentation."
msgstr ""
"कृपया &rkward;, परिचयार्थं तत्र गच्छन्तु, अस्माभिः सह सम्पर्कं कुर्वन्तु, "
"यदि भवान् उपयोक्तृदस्तावेजनिर्माणे सहायतां कर्तुं शक्नोति ।"

#: index.docbook:106
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Developer's Guide to &rkward;"
msgstr "विकासकस्य मार्गदर्शिका &rkward;"

#: index.docbook:108
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&rkward; can be extended without the need to recompile using plugins. "
"Extensive documentation on this should be included with &rkward; in DocBook "
"format, and is available in &HTML; format <ulink "
"url=\"https://api.kde.org/doc/rkwardplugins\">here</ulink>. (TODO: figure "
"out, how to include this in the documentation)."
msgstr ""
"&rkward; प्लगिन्स् इत्यस्य उपयोगेन पुनः संकलनस्य आवश्यकतां विना विस्तारितुं "
"शक्यते । अस्य विषये विस्तृतं दस्तावेजं &rkward; DocBook प्रारूपेण, तथा च "
"&HTML; प्रारूपं <ulink "
"url=\"https://api.kde.org/doc/rkwardplugins\">अत्र</ulink> । (TODO: figure "
"out, एतत् दस्तावेजीकरणे कथं समाविष्टं कर्तव्यम्)।"

